chest with the three twisted threads","[of those of] two births, having become one time one dwarf","[with] two feet, you measured the three worlds","So that the four cardinal points shook","[on] a fine-feathered bird, riding [forth]","to a slack-lipped [elephant] with three ichors [at] its two ears","you ended that one lone elephant’s anguish","one day, [too,] in the vast watery pond","You are of a nature","adored by the brahmins of three fires","the four Mysteries, five kinds of sacrifice, and six actions","you are of a nature [that is] known by those who, subduing","the five senses in the body, controlling the four together and","of the three qualities, rejecting two, remaining at one in the one [remaining]","there[by] cut away the two [types of] births","You abide in the excellence of your nature","hard to understand [for] the one with three eyes, four arms","[and] a five-headed serpent, [in whose] hair knot a river is bound","You took [up] the seven worlds on your tusks","You are the essence of the six flavors which are proclaimed","You rest [with] five weapons bursting with light in your lovely hands","You rest in yogic repose","[your] four beautiful arms [and] the hue of water of three [sources]","[that tints] your two feet at one with the minds of those","with faces like the one moon, the two Ladies who","stroke [them] in lovely flower-like hands at all three times [of the day]","You became the four different varnas of religious rule","The five great elements, which are eminent, are you","For the sake of [her in whose] tresses six-legged [bees] hum","you destroyed seven bulls so that [they] yielded. You are of a quality","which is difficult for the six various philosophies to know","You seated on your chest [her with] hair of five types","As the four beginning with virtue, as the three manifestations","as the two types of outcome, and as the One","you endure, all-pervading","O Supreme who rests [in] yogic repose on a swaying serpent bed","as brahmins bow with